# First lighting fit

This full-size Screen 06 gameplay image records the fitted beanie and the first trial of the photographed pink dye. The shoulder appeared too red under the hat and the lower coat was too bright. The final **CODEX_NEW** material fits those two regions separately using the same body and camera. The top, middle and low sample windows, in original 864 × 1536 coordinates, were (342, 1031)–(500, 1082), (354, 1088)–(485, 1146), and (342, 1146)–(492, 1172). This early image is retained as evidence only.
